    "All three candidates identified the same six behavioural assays (OFT, light-dark, FST, NOR, PPI, contextual fear conditioning/extinction). LTP/whole-cell patch-clamp and dendritic spine analysis are not behavioural assays (in vitro electrophysiology and histology) and were correctly excluded.",
