    "group_housing scored 'not_reported' (qwen/glm) rather than 'yes' (gptoss) because gptoss's evidence quote 'Animals were housed in pairs' is not present in the paper; only LTP companion-pair housing is described, which is specific to that experiment.",
    "FST setup_restrain set to 'yes' following rubric (FST cylinder explicitly listed as restraint).",
    "FST D2 session duration scored 0 (<15 min) since the actual recording bout is 6 min; gptoss incorrectly placed it in 15–60 min bin.",
    "D5_followup scored 'Yes' for assays whose recording occurred ≥24 h after the last drug administration (OFT 24 h, NOR 24 h, PPI 24 h, FST 7 d). Light-dark box at 18 h does not meet ≥24 h cutoff so scored No.",
    "Fear conditioning B1 set to 2 (4-6 measures: freezing across acquisition, expression, generalization, extinction phases) following gptoss; B2 set to Yes following glm/gptoss (within-session 5-min binned freezing during extinction).",
    "OFT B1 collapsed to '2-3' (time-course + total activity) per all candidates; B2 = Yes (5-min binned within-session time-course).",
    "E6 for fear conditioning scored 0: per rubric a single chamber is one zone even though contexts A and B are different apparatuses used across days.",
    "food/water restriction scored 'during' for all assays (food/water ad libitum in home cage but not accessible during recording), consistent with rubric guidance."
